          Colophon</h2>
          <div class="p-4">
            This website was created by paw with HTML, CSS, and a
            home-made static generator built with PHP. It was
            written using <a href=
            "https://vscodium.com/">VSCodium</a>, and is maintained
            via <a href="https://winscp.net/">WinSCP</a>. <a href=
            "https://tailwindcss.com/">Tailwind CSS</a> is used as
            a the CSS framework.<br>
            <br>
            It is currently hosted via <a href=
            "https://www.digitalocean.com/">DigitalOcean</a>.
            However, I do not support their AI priorities, and
            thus, I intend to eventually move to a new host.<br>
            <br>
            This website features no tracking, no advertisements,
            and no javascript. You can view the source code for the
            site itself and my static builder on my <a href=
            "https://github.com/rowedahelicon/rowedahelicon.com">Github
            page.</a><br>
            <br>
            Like most of my web projects, this website is designed
            to be viewed by anyone. It was built to meet <a href=
            "https://webaim.org/">WebAIM's</a> standards for web
            accessibility, and features lightweight and efficient
            coding practices.
          </div>
        </section>
        <section id="website" class="pb-5">
          <h2 class="header-2 text-4xl aero text-center">My
          supported ideas, techologies, and ethos.</h2>
          <div class="p-4">
            I believe in digital freedom. The internet is a place
            where people can bask in the collection of all of
            humanity's knowledge. It is a place meant to explore
            and challenge ideas, find those who match our weird,
            and ultimately shape ourselves freely into who we wish
            to be.<br>
            <br>
            I believe that the internet is humanity's greatest
            culture, and it has never been properly viewed,
            understood, or respected as one. I feel this is a
            tragedy that betrays the entire collective efforts of
            everyone who has ever given anything to this world.
          </div>
